    </header>
    <div class="page">

        <div class="main-content">
            


<div class="content-page bg-primary ">
    <div class="heading-section color-overlay content-light " style="background-image: url('/-/media/Website/Images/ContentPageBanner.png');background-size:cover;">
        <div class="breadcrumb"></div>
                    <div class="container">
                <div class="row">
                    <div class="heading-content col-1 gold-bar"></div>
                </div>
                <div class="row">
                    <div class="heading-content col-12">
                        <h1>Regulatory Instruments</h1>

                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
    </div>

    <div class="content-section row content-dark bg-white">
            <div class="sidenav-container col-3">
                        <div class="sidebar-title title-small-border-blue">
            <div class="title">
                <a href="/en/securities-law-and-policy" class="">
                    <i class="gold-bar"></i>
                    Securities Law &amp; Policy
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    <div class="sidebar-nav-list">
            <ul>
                        <li class="child-title">
                            <a href="/en/securities-law-and-policy/act-and-regulation" class="">
                                <i class="gold-bar"></i>
                                Act &amp; Regulation
                            </a>


                        </li>
                        <li class="child-title">
                            <a href="/en/securities-law-and-policy/regulatory-instruments" class="active">
                                <i class="gold-bar"></i>
                                Regulatory Instruments
                            </a>


                        </li>
                        <li class="child-title">
                            <a href="/en/securities-law-and-policy/regulatory-updates" class="">
                                <i class="gold-bar"></i>
                                Regulatory Updates
                            </a>


                        </li>
                        <li class="child-title">
                            <a href="/en/securities-law-and-policy/authorizations-and-memorandums-of-understanding" class="">
                                <i class="gold-bar"></i>
                                Authorizations &amp; Memorandums of Understanding
                            </a>


                        </li>
                        <li class="child-title">
                            <a href="/en/securities-law-and-policy/blanket-orders-and-designation-orders" class="">
                                <i class="gold-bar"></i>
                                Blanket Orders &amp; Designation Orders
                            </a>


                        </li>
            </ul>
    </div>

            </div>

        <div class="container col-lg-9 col-sm-12 body-container color-overlay">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-12">
                    <div class="general-content">
                                                    <div class="body"><p>The ASC uses a number of regulatory instruments to administer the requirements of Alberta's securities laws. Most regulatory instruments are numbered according to the Canadian Securities Administrators (CSA) numbering system.&nbsp;See <a rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.albertasecurities.com/-/media/ASC-Documents-part-1/Regulatory-Instruments/2018/10/5041204-v1-CSA-Notice-11-312-Jan-2015-Revised.ashx" target="_blank">CSA Staff Notice 11-312 (Revised) <em>National Numbering System</em></a> for more information.&nbsp;</p>
<p>The Regulatory Instrument table below includes all current regulatory instruments created by the ASC including the ASC Rules (General). It does not include Miscellaneous Notices.</p></div>

                        <div class="regulatory-instruments-groups">
    <div class="rendering">
        <div class="container-restraint">            
            
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="col-12 columns-content group">
                            <div class="accordion-container">
                                <div class="accordion-items">

                                    <div class="section">
                                        <a href="#" class="menu-item section-header" data-sort-order="1"  data-target=".tab-shortguid-1"><span class="arrow"></span>Alberta Securities Commission Rules (General) and Forms</a>
                                        <div class="dropdown tab-shortguid-1">
                                            <div class="height-spacer container">
                                                <div class="row no-gutters heading">
                                                    <div class="col-12"><h5>Frequently Used Instruments</h5></div>
                                                </div>

                                                            <div class="row no-gutters" data-frequently-used="1" data-date-type="As Amended">
                                                                <div class="col-lg-2 col-3 columns-content instrument-number">ASC Rules</div>
                                                                <div class="col-lg-10 col-9 columns-content"><a href="/securities-law-and-policy/regulatory-instruments/ASC Rules">Alberta Securities Commission Rules (General) and Forms</a></div>
                                                            </div>
                                                
                                                <div class="row no-gutters footer">
                                                    <div class="col-12"><a href="/en/Securities-Law-and-Policy/Regulatory-Instruments/Alberta-Securities-Commission-Rules-General-and-Forms">See all Alberta Securities Commission Rules (General) and Forms</a></div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="section">
                                        <a href="#" class="menu-item section-header" data-sort-order="2"  data-target=".tab-shortguid-2"><span class="arrow"></span>Procedure and Related Matters [11-101 - 15-702]</a>
                                        <div class="dropdown tab-shortguid-2">
                                            <div class="height-spacer container">
                                                <div class="row no-gutters heading">
                                                    <div class="col-12"><h5>Frequently Used Instruments</h5></div>
                                                </div>

                                                            <div class="row no-gutters" data-frequently-used="1" data-date-type="As Amended">
                                                                <div class="col-lg-2 col-3 columns-content instrument-number">11-102</div>
                                                                <div class="col-lg-10 col-9 columns-content"><a href="/securities-law-and-policy/regulatory-instruments/11-102">Passport System [MI]</a></div>
                                                            </div>
                                                            <div class="row no-gutters" data-frequently-used="1" data-date-type="As Amended">
                                                                <div class="col-lg-2 col-3 columns-content instrument-number">13-501</div>
                                                                <div class="col-lg-10 col-9 columns-content"><a href="/securities-law-and-policy/regulatory-instruments/13-501">Fees [ASC Rule]</a></div>
                                                            </div>
                                                            <div class="row no-gutters" data-frequently-used="1" data-date-type="Published">
                                                                <div class="col-lg-2 col-3 columns-content instrument-number">15-501</div>
                                                                <div class="col-lg-10 col-9 columns-content"><a href="/securities-law-and-policy/regulatory-instruments/15-501">Rules of Practice and Procedure for Commission Proceedings [ASC Rule]</a></div>
                                                            </div>
                                                
                                                <div class="row no-gutters footer">
                                                    <div class="col-12"><a href="/en/Securities-Law-and-Policy/Regulatory-Instruments/Procedure-and-Related-Matters">See all Procedure and Related Matters [11-101 - 15-702]</a></div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="section">
                                        <a href="#" class="menu-item section-header" data-sort-order="3"  data-target=".tab-shortguid-3"><span class="arrow"></span>Certain Capital Market Participants [21-101 - 26-101]</a>
                                        <div class="dropdown tab-shortguid-3">
                                            <div class="height-spacer container">
                                                <div class="row no-gutters heading">
                                                    <div class="col-12"><h5>Frequently Used Instruments</h5></div>
                                                </div>

                                                            <div class="row no-gutters" data-frequently-used="1" data-date-type="As Amended">
                                                                <div class="col-lg-2 col-3 columns-content instrument-number">21-101</div>
                                                                <div class="col-lg-10 col-9 columns-content"><a href="/securities-law-and-policy/regulatory-instruments/21-101">Marketplace Operation [NI]</a></div>
                                                            </div>
                                                            <div class="row no-gutters" data-frequently-used="1" data-date-type="As Amended">
                                                                <div class="col-lg-2 col-3 columns-content instrument-number">23-101</div>
                                                                <div class="col-lg-10 col-9 columns-content"><a href="/securities-law-and-policy/regulatory-instruments/23-101">Trading Rules [NI]</a></div>
